     1,
     "You can&#39;t retrieve by column name, but you can associate a column name with an index.  Just do something like this to figure out the appropriate column indexes<div><br></div><div><div>for(i in 1:length(readval[[2]][[2]])) {</div><div> print(readval[[2]][[2]][i])</div><div> print(i)</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>[1] &quot;base:Desc&quot;</div><div>[1] 1</div><div>[1] &quot;base:Name&quot;</div><div>[1] 2</div><div>[1] &quot;base:Value&quot;</div><div>[1] 3</div></div>"
    ],
